WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
Hey, Thoughty2 here.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:10.480
The Sun takes 220 million years to orbit the
galaxy, a journey it has made 20 times so far.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.180
Welcome to RIF!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:25.640
More than half the world's population is under
25 and more than half of it is bilingual.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.980
Coca-Cola in the Maldives is made from seawater.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:36.589
In 1567, the man said to have the longest
beard in the world died after he tripped over

00:00:36.589 --> 00:00:39.819
his beard running away from a fire.

00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:45.620
The common shrew protects itself from predators
by dying of fright.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:53.340
95% of all data in the world is still stored
on paper. Most of it is never looked at again.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:01:01.059
The world's deepest postbox is in Susami Bay
in Japan. It's 10 metres underwater.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:07.780
In the Inuit language, Inuktitut, there is
a word that looks like this iminngernaveersaartunngortussaavunga.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.220
And it means “I should try not to become
an alcoholic”.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:19.130
The strongest creatures on Earth are gonorrhoea
bacteria. They can pull 100,000 times their

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:21.350
own body weight.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:29.930
In 1997, 39 people in the UK found themselves
in hospital with tea-cosy-related injuries.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:35.660
Both Gorillas and potatoes have two more chromosomes
than people.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:43.320
More gold is recoverable from a tonne of personal
computers than from 17 tonnes of gold ore.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:51.380
2,520 is the smallest number that can be exactly
divided by all the numbers between 1 to 10.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:59.360
It takes ten times as much energy to heat
water as it does to heat iron.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:06.480
The Dance Fever of 1518 was a month-long plague
of inexplicable dancing in Strasbourg.

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:11.940
In which hundreds of people danced for about
a month for no apparent reason.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.140
Several of them danced themselves to death.

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:21.180
Alexander the Great washed his hair in saffron
to keep it shiny and orange.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.160
Thanks for the view!

